# Celebrate the Mountain-king: "When this enchantment enters, for each opponent, exile up to one target nonland permanent
# that player controls until this enchantment leaves the battlefield." and "When this enchantment enters, recruit." Bot2
# controls an Ornithopter and an Island, Bot1 an Ornithopter: only Bot2's nonland permanent may be targeted (CR 115.1). Recruit
# draws a Plains and discards it (a land card: no Soldier token, CR 701.70a). Bot2 destroys the enchantment with Disenchant,
# and the Ornithopter returns under its owner's control at once (CR 610.3a).

